'''Spring''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife which was obtainable by purchasing the fifth tier of the Easter battlepass which costs 1,920 [[Eggs (Currency)|eggs]]{{Currency|Egg}} in the [[Easter Event 2024]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event as since ended

== Appearance ==
The top of the blade is white, as you go down through the blade it starts fading into blue which symbolises a sky and after into green symbolising grass, the guard is golden and the handle is black.

